abstract: "Complete 722-module Turkish reader with a clean title page, plus a replayable reviewer index of 194 recovered historical term decisions and 6,944 located occurrences. The internal source-revision hash was removed from the reader-facing page and retained in technical provenance; no translated body changed. Rejected alternatives were not present in the recovered ledger and are not invented. The successor source/evidence archives repair their member manifests and remove two whitespace-split private-path occurrences from one build log."
